      ],
      "units": "revolutions",
      "rule": "each side takes roll + its side offset; rollL=+t, rollR=-t is a spin on the spot",
      "distance_per_rev_m": 2.011,
      "cyclic": "near — one revolution returns the hub lugs and the index notch exactly; the tread advances 2.011 m over a 0.155 m lug period (12.97 lugs), so roll:1 differs from roll:0 by 9 of 4612 painted px (0.20%, 0 px of alpha change). Seamless in motion, not bit-identical."
