      "param": "yaw",
      "units": "degrees",
      "range": [
        -45,
        45
      ],
      "what": "heading off the 45deg facing grid. SHE HAS NO STEER AXLE — nothing on this machine yaws but the machine itself, so this IS her steering. The model turns about z before projection under the fixed key, so the shading is rebaked, not rotated.",
